{"url":"http://127.0.0.1:5199/about","panes":1,"text":"About\nPortfolio Hub\nExperiments\n2\nJournal\nSoftware\nLate-Breaking News\nWebspring 4.0 enters first implementation\n14 May 2026\nNSE and Atmo define the interface layer\n6 May 2026\nAbout\nSyndromatic\n\nThe finest designs in the galaxy\n\nTactile, high-aesthetic digital and physical systems that bring joy and dignity to software.\n\nDesign at the speed of thought\n\nSyndromatic is a design and software studio for tactile interfaces, visual identity, icons, media, product concepts and web systems.\n\nThe logo, the texture, the window, the motion and the control all need a point of view. The work should feel useful, memorable and unmistakably Syndromatic.\n\nDisciplines\nGraphic Design\nLogo Design\nInterfaces\nIconography\nVideography\nAnimation\nProduct Concepts\nSynWare\nVisual Systems\nThe studio\n\nSyndromatic Ltd is led by Kavish Krishnakumar, its founder, and Polkrit Panluek, its co-founder. The studio works between Manchester and London.\n\nSTUDIOS\nManchester and London\nFOUNDERS\nKavish Krishnakumar and Polkrit Panluek\nWEBSPRING 4.0\nLaunches 25 October 2026\n\n© 2026 Syndromatic Ltd. All rights reserved.\n\nWebspring 4.0 · SynCloudOS 1.0 beta\n\nCompany\nFramework\nTeam","errors":[]}
